abstract: >
  MOF is an open-source Python framework for multi-objective trustworthiness
  analysis under a constrained Lagrangian formulation. It separates dataset
  supply, modality-specific training/explainability (ECG use case), and a
  modality-agnostic core that applies configurable f_P, f_S, and f_E formulas
  and computes feasibility frontiers with shadow prices.
